  "description": "This uses following query paramters\nSvcTime - Service time in milli-seconds and applied 10ms delay in each API\nStatus - HTTP Status code e.g. 404, 200, 500\nhttp://{host}/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&Status=200\"\nhttp://{host}/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&Status=404\"\nhttp://{host}/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&Status=500\"\nOr\nLocation - If status is 301 or 302, then Location is used and set in the repsonse \ne.g http://192.168.1.40/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&Status=301&Location=/tours/index.html\nOr\nRespSize - Size of response body\nhttp://{host}/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&RespSize=128\nOr\nRespSameAsReq - Y/N. If Y, then whatever comes in Req body, it is send back in response\nhttp://{host}/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&RespSameAsReq=Y\nOr\nCloseConnection - Y/N. If Y, then hpd will close the connection.\nhttp://{host}/url_service/url_test.xml?CloseConnection=Y\nHeader  (Upto 50 headers)\nHdr??=<headername: hdr value>\ne.g http://192.168.1.40/url_service/url_test.xml?SvcTime=10&Status=404&RespSize=128&Hdr1=MyHdr: MyHdrValue",
